      "trackName": "Survival Tank World",
      "description": "Battle endless waves of enemies in this intense tank survival game designed for Apple Watch!\n\nSurvive increasingly difficult waves of enemies — Smashers, Commanders, Bosses, and more — using your wrist controls. Between waves, choose upgrades to evolve your tank: add cannons, deploy drones, become an Overlord, or sacrifice everything for the devastating God Tank.\n\nFEATURES\n• Fast-paced wave survival gameplay\n• 20+ tank upgrade paths — Double Cannon, Octo Tank, Necromancer, Factory, and more\n• Epic boss battles: Summoner and Elite Destroyer\n• Leaderboard-style high score tracking\n• Designed exclusively for Apple Watch — no iPhone required\n\nHow long can you survive?",
